      },
      "message": "fix(machines): source the ALC400G taper and state the taper limit (#1501)\n\nThe 25 deg taper is Sodick's published figure for the ALC400G (sodick.co.th\nEDW page, 130 mm work height). The file now says in its description that\nthe taper is data only: no guide heights, no wire plane (#1800). A test\npins the post refusal of a tapered cut. No schema or post change.\n\nRefs #1800\nFixes #1501\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
