      "message": "docs(decisions): name the real taper limits for the ALC400G (#1501)\n\nThe decision named a \"wire plane\" refusal that does not exist and an old\ntest name. The real limits are the guide-height and max_taper checks in\nwire_edm.rs and the vertical-only rule in sodick-wire.cps.\n\nRefs #1501\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
